00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.900
Episode 6

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:26.490
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:22.970
Wife of Wang Wook, Prince of Goryeo, from the Hae clan

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:36.590
Translators: tamaramin, Kaia, Nemie, Kodan

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:46.690
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:56.790
Typesetters: Nemie, Sana

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:54.090
Sister...

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:58.890
Can we see each other again?

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:08.290
I miss you already

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:12.990
What to do next?

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:15.860
Just look for me

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:19.090
And I

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:24.890
I'll look for you

00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:31.350
Okay,

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.050
that I have such a friend

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.590
I...

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.710
Why didn't I say?

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:55.260
I knew very well that she always wanted to hear these words from me

00:03:58.290 --> 00:04:00.670
I couldn't tell you how much I love and respect her

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:07.140
I always thought it wasn't like that

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:14.490
But Su...

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.890
I had these feelings in my heart

00:04:27.090 --> 00:04:28.500
I thought it was gratitude...

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:32.290
But it was love

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:37.690
I always thought it was very comfortable and calm to be with her.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:48.280
But it was love

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.890
What should I do?

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.940
Su, what should I do?

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:14.540
I should have told her

00:05:15.090 --> 00:05:17.050
She was probably waiting for these words

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:24.800
Sister might know

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:28.000
She knew about everything...

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:31.110
so stop it

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:32.430
Okay?

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.670
Why only now...

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:41.950
Only now I...

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.650
Did you understand her feelings?

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:49.010
Why? Why? Why?

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:51.010
Why only now?

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:20.640
What should I do next?

00:06:21.670 --> 00:06:23.790
What should I do?

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:27.570
Roll a ball in your head...

00:06:50.930 --> 00:06:52.870
Who is this?

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:55.890
Who's there...

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:05.730
Oh my God!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:08.750
And why are all the princes already married?

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.000
What impudence! How indecent of you!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.190
You should be taught a lesson!

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:17.670
And what is it?

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:18.490
What's so funny?

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:21.810
The prince has not a shred of decency!
He just needs to be taught a lesson!

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:26.730
Come on, get out!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:28.270
Get your hands off me!

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.550
Here we go...

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:35.490
What impudence!

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:36.670
Really?

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:38.130
How are you talking to the prince?!

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:39.750
So what if you're a prince?

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:43.510
Dare to hit a girl?

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:44.510
You little one!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.490
What are you doing?

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:09.390
And really... How did you come up with the idea of ​​making puppet men?

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:11.920
I even felt a little emotional

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:13.290
You are the best!

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:15.720
You're happy, and that's the main thing!

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:19.280
My daughter-in-law died and I was afraid that you would be very sad

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:20.790
But...

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:23.400
What is this?

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:26.690
Cool! Means "the best"

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:29.690
Of all the fingers on your hand
big is not the most respected?

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:33.590
No! Isn't His Majesty the most respected?

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:38.080
I think this finger is quite good

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.890
Well, that's great

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:45.890
10th Prince, today you are the best!

00:08:46.590 --> 00:08:48.790
Thanks to you I laughed

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:53.590
It's bad that in your life I'm the only one best

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.330
Prince, today you are the best!

00:08:57.730 --> 00:08:58.700
Certainly!

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.270
- Enough!
- Prince! Prince is truly the best!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.290
Is it true?

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:05.340
- Stop it!
- Prince! The prince has grown up to be the most handsome!

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:06.790
- You're serious, right?
- I told you to stop

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:08.210
Then who do you like best?

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:08.890
Prince Eun, of course!

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:10.290
You've had enough

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:28.300
Never apologized to me

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:34.340
You misunderstood me and mother

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:36.710
You only know how to bark at others

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:41.490
We could be brothers

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:44.290
but you don’t even deign to say hello

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:47.740
Shouldn't I be the one receiving the greetings?

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:49.940
I saved him from death

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:51.870
How long have you

00:09:51.870 --> 00:09:54.110
are you going to stay on the crown prince's side?

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.290
That's why I traded my life for this

00:10:02.340 --> 00:10:03.510
What?

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:04.740
Brother!

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.540
Have you heard that the Hupaekje people will now live in Songak?

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:13.460
His Majesty will give everyone land

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:17.260
Whether it's Balhae or Hubaekje, His Majesty will devour them

00:10:17.540 --> 00:10:19.060
This is our Koryo

00:10:19.190 --> 00:10:19.890
That's right

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:23.160
The collapse of the nation is a matter of time

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:26.260
Look at the 13th Prince's grandfather

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:28.390
Was a powerful king of Silla,

00:10:28.760 --> 00:10:30.690
and now it clings to our ruler in order to survive

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.040
He doesn't even dare show himself in the palace.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:35.660
All he can do is grovel

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:37.790
But

00:10:38.110 --> 00:10:39.790
we are the same as them

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:42.060
Just nothing without an emperor

00:10:43.610 --> 00:10:46.160
We eat the same food given to us by the owner,

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.660
so what to talk about?

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:50.640
What?

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:53.740
Will you grovel or eat like a dog?

00:10:54.790 --> 00:10:57.140
you still won’t dare say anything to the owner

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:59.490
So there's no need to talk nonsense

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:05.990
Instead... wouldn't it be better to go have a drink?

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:13.360
Paek A,

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.710
Are you drinking?

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:20.060
Yes, brother, drinking is my talent

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:28.210
Thank you brother

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:32.390
I didn't say this because of you, don't thank me

00:11:32.890 --> 00:11:35.860
I just hate people who humiliate the weak

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:38.660
I'm grateful that you calmed my anger

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:42.410
I wouldn't even have the courage to say it all

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:49.300
Time flies so fast

00:11:49.970 --> 00:11:53.310
And it's true, I've been here long enough

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:58.130
At first I was worried that I wouldn’t be able to live here,

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:00.550
and now I think that everything is not so bad

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.030
That's just...

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:07.670
How long should I be Hae Soo?

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:12.790
I always wanted to tell my sister

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.290
these are the words:

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:22.070
forgive me... for everything

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:24.450
And thank you

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:29.490
Hey Hae Soo!

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:32.670
Sister!

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:35.650
- Sister Hae Soo!
- Be careful, you'll fall...

00:12:37.050 --> 00:12:38.190
Fai-ting!

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:40.950
Fightin'

00:12:40.950 --> 00:12:41.830
Sister!

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:44.050
Sister!

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:46.820
Have you been doing well?

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.580
Where are you all coming from?

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.720
We went to visit our sister-in-law

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:52.370
She was probably happy

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:58.360
Then, since you find out first, you can go and tell Myung Hee about it yourself

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:01.610
I have good news

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.870
You'll get married soon

00:13:05.940 --> 00:13:07.380
Married?..

00:13:07.380 --> 00:13:08.660
Me?!

00:13:12.670 --> 00:13:16.450
Are you planning to marry Hae Soo?

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:20.930
Clear. It's just a little sudden

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:24.740
She is just of marriageable age. We can't forget about it

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:29.040
Luckily, we found her a wonderful man

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:35.920
It won't be that hard for her to get married like this

00:13:37.570 --> 00:13:41.410
But still, my wife just recently left us

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:43.250
Why marry her off now?

00:13:44.270 --> 00:13:46.410
You should give her some time

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:48.370
On the contrary, it's good

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:51.120
If she spends too much time in the house where her daughter-in-law died,

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:53.870
This doesn't bode well for her future marriage.

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.490
Your Highness, we hope for your understanding

00:13:56.490 --> 00:13:58.510
We can't lose this opportunity

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:06.500
Marriage? This is so shocking!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:09.760
But it's true that she has reached marriageable age

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:12.380
You are here now, you can object to marriage

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:13.570
This issue is resolved by the House of He

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:15.200
We have no right to object

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:18.490
Brother! Brother! Brother!

00:14:18.490 --> 00:14:20.830
Is it true that Hae Soo is getting married?

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:23.110
Beck Ah, did you hear?

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:24.600
Brother Eun heard somewhere

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:28.990
The man she will marry is over 60 and has many sons

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:32.550
This stupid thing. Does she know what awaits her?

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:35.720
If this is true, then this is not a marriage. She was just sold

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:37.660
Yes, it was sold

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:39.550
What did you just say?

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:43.060
Say it again

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:45.210
Which house is Su being sent to?

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:46.780
Brother, this is too much!

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.430
How can you treat Su like this?

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:52.090
The man she's marrying offered a deal -

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:53.980
compensate for the losses of He's house

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:56.640
It's dishonest to sell Su like this

00:14:59.590 --> 00:15:02.090
I'll try to find a way out

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:20.790
Chae Ryung, I want to leave

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:21.910
What?

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:24.470
How can I live with a man I have never seen before?

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:27.360
My sister would never wish such a fate on me

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.450
Give it to me, I have to run

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:30.860
Hurry, hurry!

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:37.000
Yes! Run! Go away!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:42.020
Even if they beat me to death, I won't tell them where you went

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:46.060
Chae Ryung...

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.460
Su! Come out quickly

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:55.120
Faster!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.560
Will you be okay?

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:38.990
I can't give you away like this

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:51.270
That's what this kid said

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:57.290
Brother?

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:01.820
Follow him!

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:14.490
- Stop!
- Stop!

00:17:14.490 --> 00:17:15.490
Stop!

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:28.980
Brother, stop!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:38.900
What kind of impudence?

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.790
Dare to stand in the way of the princes?!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:43.720
- Brother
- Oh, Yong Hwa?

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:45.890
What's happened? Did something happen at home?

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:47.430
Sorry,

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:51.500
but it seems my niece is a great burden to you

00:17:58.210 --> 00:17:59.940
Surprise!

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:04.090
Have you confused your niece with my brother?

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:06.380
Find them! Now!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:41.190
I never thought that you would help me too

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:47.540
I just don't want to see how others manage your life

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:51.490
This kind of life has no meaning

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.860
Hello Your Highness

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:44.250
What brought you here, and with the palace guards at that?

00:19:44.960 --> 00:19:48.290
Isn’t this Miss Su from the 8th Prince’s house?

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:51.780
You need to come with me

00:19:51.780 --> 00:19:53.010
Why do you need it?

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:58.270
Did the man who wants to marry her ask for a favor?

00:19:58.270 --> 00:19:59.600
Chi Mon

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:02.020
Close your eyes to this just once

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:03.920
How can she marry such a man?

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:05.230
Don't you feel sorry for her?

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:07.930
Lady Su was ordered to enter the palace

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:14.860
What does it mean to “enter the palace”?

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:20.100
Really...

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:23.940
It has been confirmed that the Emperor will marry Hae Soo

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:25.390
I'm here to pick her up

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:29.330
It can't be

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.710
It's probably a mistake

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:33.020
It was sudden, but

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:35.570
daughter of the Hong Ha Jin Hae clan and the In Gyu Go Myung clan, Lady Soo,

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.490
she will definitely marry the emperor

00:20:38.490 --> 00:20:39.940
Have you heard anything about this?

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:41.620
No, nothing at all

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.740
This is impossible. Why would I...

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:47.430
Okay. Don't get down and wait

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.240
4th Prince

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:56.440
Astronomer Chi Mon!

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:58.700
Astronomer!

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:03.350
Your Highness

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:07.690
How did this happen? Marrying the Emperor?

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:11.060
Oh, you've already heard

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:16.020
The Emperor recognized the merits of the He House

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:18.720
He wants to become our relative

00:21:18.720 --> 00:21:22.160
Why didn't you tell me that Su would marry His Majesty?

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:25.710
Myung Hee died

00:21:25.710 --> 00:21:28.330
we are no longer connected

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:32.620
Let our Su give birth to a child for the emperor

00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:38.790
And you may have relationship problems because of the throne

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:43.390
Were you afraid that we would stop the marriage if we found out?

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:47.580
We have nothing more to discuss, let's go back

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:52.580
Move away

00:21:53.980 --> 00:21:55.370
Move away!

00:21:57.800 --> 00:22:00.850
You yourself know what will happen if you disobey the imperial order

00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:04.330
Let her go, brother! Is it possible to disobey the emperor?

00:22:04.330 --> 00:22:07.250
All our brothers could die because of her

00:22:23.760 --> 00:22:25.290
I told you not to move

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:26.860
I think I should go

00:22:27.620 --> 00:22:31.610
If you go now, it will be difficult to leave the palace

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:38.660
I have to

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:41.440
Then no one will get hurt

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:11.250
And you really won't regret it?

00:23:12.380 --> 00:23:13.750
Don't worry

00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:17.000
I'll try to talk to him

00:23:21.280 --> 00:23:22.760
Sit down in the palanquin

00:24:26.590 --> 00:24:28.320
Let's return to the palace!

00:24:45.790 --> 00:24:47.260
Stupid girl

00:24:48.290 --> 00:24:51.420
A man over 60 and a bunch of sons?

00:24:51.420 --> 00:24:52.750
This is our emperor! Emperor!

00:24:52.750 --> 00:24:54.650
Where have you heard this?

00:25:01.010 --> 00:25:03.210
The Empress is here!

00:25:09.840 --> 00:25:11.490
Such a busy man

00:25:12.090 --> 00:25:13.710
and arranges a wedding?

00:25:15.910 --> 00:25:18.960
What's the rush from the first wedding night to the actual ceremony?

00:25:24.960 --> 00:25:27.260
The Khitans are advancing

00:25:28.090 --> 00:25:31.490
We must join forces with the He Clan
Hong Ha Jin to protect the northern border

00:25:33.110 --> 00:25:36.910
When will the powerful clans of our country be satisfied with the imperial family?

00:25:38.110 --> 00:25:42.190
The people have no hope for the crown prince, they are digging his grave!

00:25:42.410 --> 00:25:44.610
That's why you are targeting his life?!

00:25:44.740 --> 00:25:47.190
I dug a grave for myself and my son!

00:25:49.710 --> 00:25:51.340
Still doubt me?

00:25:52.910 --> 00:25:57.840
My wife, you have everything. I doubt your greed!

00:26:02.640 --> 00:26:04.110
I don't think I can

00:26:05.240 --> 00:26:07.290
change your opinion about me

00:26:33.270 --> 00:26:36.550
I won't end up marrying Taejo, will I?

00:26:38.250 --> 00:26:41.630
No, even though I'm in Goryeo now, this is wrong!

00:26:41.630 --> 00:26:43.560
Who knows what else will go wrong?

00:26:50.970 --> 00:26:52.820
Keep your head straight

00:26:53.590 --> 00:26:55.700
Don't panic, you can handle it

00:26:56.700 --> 00:27:00.270
Must definitely survive

00:27:13.460 --> 00:27:16.290
Damiwon Palace

00:27:23.100 --> 00:27:25.970
After an hour, change the herbal bag

00:27:26.160 --> 00:27:28.360
Concubine Oh! Concubine Oh!

00:27:30.030 --> 00:27:33.420
Astronomer Ji Mon conveyed news of the ruler's new wife

00:27:34.390 --> 00:27:36.520
When and what family is she from?

00:27:44.860 --> 00:27:46.930
Damiwon Palace was built to take care of

00:27:46.930 --> 00:27:49.010
about the spirit and body of the emperor and princes

00:27:49.010 --> 00:27:51.410
This is where you will prepare for the wedding

00:27:51.410 --> 00:27:52.140
Sorry

00:27:53.140 --> 00:27:57.250
I haven't heard anything about weddings at all.

00:27:57.250 --> 00:27:59.370
I apologize to the emperor, but...

00:27:59.370 --> 00:28:02.550
Can you tell him there was a misunderstanding?

00:28:02.550 --> 00:28:05.090
Do you want to refuse marriage with the emperor?

00:28:05.090 --> 00:28:07.990
Not only from marriage with the emperor, but also from marriage with his grandfather

00:28:07.990 --> 00:28:10.090
I have no intention of marrying someone I don't know

00:28:10.090 --> 00:28:11.360
God, concubine Oh!

00:28:13.870 --> 00:28:18.350
I wanted to see you so much, my eyes became so big

00:28:19.160 --> 00:28:20.640
Is this her?

00:28:21.820 --> 00:28:24.150
This is Miss Su from the Hong Ha Jin He clan.

00:28:24.740 --> 00:28:28.500
Now that you're here, I can take my leave.

00:28:31.820 --> 00:28:34.260
Just follow your destiny

00:28:37.280 --> 00:28:38.510
Astronomer

00:28:40.250 --> 00:28:44.250
From now on, in front of us, don't treat yourself like that,
like you're just a commoner

00:28:45.250 --> 00:28:47.280
Oh, it's... me...

00:28:47.280 --> 00:28:48.660
Follow me lady

00:28:52.040 --> 00:28:53.590
Let's go

00:29:02.220 --> 00:29:05.190
It's difficult with her, very difficult

00:29:05.190 --> 00:29:07.630
What did the emperor see in her?

00:29:18.290 --> 00:29:21.480
We examine your body before we wash it

00:29:21.480 --> 00:29:22.620
Why?

00:29:23.380 --> 00:29:26.300
A woman with scars on her body cannot become the emperor's wife

00:29:26.300 --> 00:29:28.580
That's why we have to check you

00:29:28.580 --> 00:29:29.940
I don't want to!

00:29:31.510 --> 00:29:33.290
I have no scars

00:29:33.290 --> 00:29:37.280
I don't like it when people look at me
that's why I didn't even go to public baths

00:29:37.280 --> 00:29:38.860
And you're asking me to be naked?

00:29:38.860 --> 00:29:41.480
What are you doing? What are you doing?!

00:29:41.480 --> 00:29:44.470
- Wait!
- You will share a bed today

00:29:44.470 --> 00:29:46.730
This won't take long, sorry for being rude

00:29:46.730 --> 00:29:50.080
Shall we share a bed?! Wait! Wait!

00:29:50.080 --> 00:29:52.350
What are you talking about?! She asked me to stop!

00:29:52.490 --> 00:29:53.330
Stop!

00:29:56.240 --> 00:29:58.820
I'm sure you've heard about the emperor's marriage

00:29:58.820 --> 00:30:00.640
Aren't you going to stop him?

00:30:01.300 --> 00:30:05.230
He does this in the interests of the empire. How can I be against it?

00:30:06.140 --> 00:30:09.660
You always carried Buddhist beads with you and now it seems that you have become a saint

00:30:09.660 --> 00:30:12.140
His Majesty already has 29 women

00:30:12.140 --> 00:30:15.030
He could take into account the interests of the family, not only the interests of the empire

00:30:15.030 --> 00:30:19.350
Does he want the empire to be divided into 25 parts after his death?

00:30:19.350 --> 00:30:21.800
How can you say that?

00:30:22.400 --> 00:30:24.340
The 14th Prince is here

00:30:25.430 --> 00:30:26.850
Tell him to come in

00:30:29.960 --> 00:30:32.480
The 14th Prince greets you, Queen Hwangbo

00:30:32.480 --> 00:30:33.680
Come in

00:30:35.090 --> 00:30:36.410
Help, mom

00:30:36.410 --> 00:30:38.060
Do you know Su from my 8th brother's house?

00:30:38.060 --> 00:30:41.110
Hae Soo marries the Emperor. Please stop this

00:30:44.160 --> 00:30:46.890
So will he marry her?

00:30:48.160 --> 00:30:52.220
You don't seem to care. Because you're related to her?

00:30:54.890 --> 00:30:57.090
Who can stop the emperor's wedding?

00:30:57.090 --> 00:30:58.980
You're trying to get over your head

00:30:59.900 --> 00:31:03.690
But it is her house that forces Su to do this. She doesn't even want to get married

00:31:03.690 --> 00:31:05.180
Mom...

00:31:05.180 --> 00:31:06.770
The 8th Prince is here

00:31:21.820 --> 00:31:24.780
The 8th Prince greets you, Empress Yu

00:31:28.370 --> 00:31:30.410
What kind of unexpected visit?

00:31:31.630 --> 00:31:34.070
- Well...
- Brother, did you come because of Hae Soo?

00:31:34.070 --> 00:31:37.020
You see? This is a big problem

00:31:37.020 --> 00:31:39.210
You have to work it out, mom.

00:31:39.700 --> 00:31:41.150
I know you can

00:31:42.550 --> 00:31:43.660
Uk

00:31:44.980 --> 00:31:47.310
Is this marriage bothering you?

00:31:47.310 --> 00:31:48.570
Why?

00:31:52.000 --> 00:31:55.430
She's like my little sister

00:31:56.000 --> 00:31:58.500
And it's very sudden

00:31:58.500 --> 00:32:00.900
- Also...
- She's his dead wife's cousin.

00:32:00.900 --> 00:32:02.870
Of course he's worried

00:32:06.370 --> 00:32:08.250
This is marriage to the emperor

00:32:09.220 --> 00:32:11.290
I'm curious, why are you worried about her?

00:32:16.600 --> 00:32:17.820
Your Highness!

00:32:30.670 --> 00:32:31.970
Let's

00:32:31.970 --> 00:32:34.760
You must find a way to save Su

00:32:34.760 --> 00:32:37.780
She came here on her own. Let him endure now

00:32:37.780 --> 00:32:41.120
If she had resisted, we would all have been killed.

00:32:41.120 --> 00:32:44.630
Anyway, she could run away if she wanted

00:32:46.040 --> 00:32:48.230
- No one can stop it now
- Brother!

00:32:52.080 --> 00:32:55.560
Do you have feelings for her?

00:32:55.960 --> 00:32:57.190
That's why you're doing this?

00:32:57.190 --> 00:32:59.200
I have feelings, but not me

00:33:01.580 --> 00:33:05.250
But she is special to me too

00:33:07.090 --> 00:33:11.360
After Myung Hee died, we drank together every day.

00:33:11.910 --> 00:33:16.860
If you liked your sister so much, why didn't you tell her?

00:33:19.640 --> 00:33:21.720
Well...

00:33:22.280 --> 00:33:25.240
Well, my mom...

00:33:26.420 --> 00:33:28.790
She is from the Silla royal family that fell

00:33:29.700 --> 00:33:32.820
We are all princes, but not all on the same level

00:33:33.370 --> 00:33:37.220
Back then your family enjoyed high prestige

00:33:38.170 --> 00:33:40.720
I was not in a position to ask for Myung Hee

00:33:40.720 --> 00:33:42.630
Here we go again!

00:33:42.630 --> 00:33:46.210
Stop saying that you can take possession of a person and so on.

00:33:46.210 --> 00:33:49.740
This is a place where people are treated like property.

00:33:51.020 --> 00:33:53.030
Just wait a thousand years

00:33:53.030 --> 00:33:55.230
You won't belong to anyone

00:33:55.270 --> 00:33:57.730
And no one will belong to you

00:33:57.730 --> 00:33:59.110
Prince? Pfft

00:33:59.110 --> 00:34:00.890
Be careful what you say

00:34:00.890 --> 00:34:03.300
How much of that life?

00:34:03.300 --> 00:34:04.960
- You always go on and on...
- Quiet

00:34:04.960 --> 00:34:09.440
Status is this, prince is that...

00:34:09.440 --> 00:34:10.810
Damn

00:34:12.030 --> 00:34:14.970
Beck Ah, listen here

00:34:15.940 --> 00:34:20.980
You can live well, but you will still die one day

00:34:20.980 --> 00:34:23.820
You might fall from the sky

00:34:23.850 --> 00:34:27.060
and end up in a place like this

00:34:29.270 --> 00:34:32.630
So follow your heart and live

00:34:33.130 --> 00:34:36.170
Do what you want and live how you want

00:34:36.170 --> 00:34:37.230
That's it!

00:34:39.200 --> 00:34:40.240
OK?

00:34:45.680 --> 00:34:46.690
OK?

00:34:46.900 --> 00:34:47.990
Okay

00:34:48.720 --> 00:34:52.060
She spoke so thoughtlessly, and you just listened?

00:34:52.060 --> 00:34:53.420
She didn't say anything wrong

00:34:53.420 --> 00:34:56.350
Look at Koryo. Family connections and more

00:34:56.350 --> 00:34:59.690
You are accepted only if you are handsome and from a rich family

00:34:59.690 --> 00:35:01.600
You get recognition if you have a successful marriage.

00:35:02.310 --> 00:35:04.790
You and I are not particularly respected

00:35:05.090 --> 00:35:07.250
How hard is it for ordinary people to live?

00:35:07.250 --> 00:35:08.290
And what?

00:35:08.370 --> 00:35:10.100
Do you want to overthrow the ruler?

00:35:10.100 --> 00:35:11.910
Are you going to change the nation?

00:35:12.750 --> 00:35:16.080
I only want to be free

00:35:16.280 --> 00:35:19.240
You want this too. And Hae Soo?

00:35:19.240 --> 00:35:22.230
How can a girl without parents and relatives survive in this place?

00:35:23.230 --> 00:35:24.770
After tonight

00:35:25.630 --> 00:35:27.800
she won't even see the emperor

00:35:29.820 --> 00:35:33.530
She will suffocate and die

00:35:49.620 --> 00:35:52.840
We have completed your examination, now you can wash yourself.

00:35:52.840 --> 00:35:54.730
I want to be alone

00:35:54.730 --> 00:35:57.680
You get married after sunset

00:35:57.680 --> 00:36:00.690
The Emperor is waiting, so... quickly

00:36:00.690 --> 00:36:02.170
Let me go!

00:36:05.030 --> 00:36:08.360
Just this morning I didn't know what would happen

00:36:08.360 --> 00:36:11.250
I need time to understand what's going on

00:36:12.990 --> 00:36:16.620
Wait here, I'll prepare you a bath

00:36:26.970 --> 00:36:28.200
Wedding?

00:36:28.700 --> 00:36:30.110
Shall we share a bed?

00:36:31.470 --> 00:36:34.380
We need to run, but where?

00:36:39.330 --> 00:36:41.800
Ah, a secret tunnel!

00:36:42.230 --> 00:36:44.020
I'm sure the entrance is here!

00:37:25.010 --> 00:37:26.340
Pride?

00:37:26.790 --> 00:37:29.010
My father forced her into marriage

00:37:29.990 --> 00:37:32.390
Crown Prince, save me...

00:37:32.390 --> 00:37:33.940
Is that what you said?

00:37:33.940 --> 00:37:36.540
A rabbit always digs two holes into its hole.

00:37:37.190 --> 00:37:39.340
When a fool guards the front entrance,

00:37:39.340 --> 00:37:42.840
the rabbit will run out through the back

00:37:43.760 --> 00:37:45.350
The Choi Chi Mon I knew

00:37:45.350 --> 00:37:47.890
would never make just one exit

00:37:48.760 --> 00:37:51.310
He would do two or more

00:37:56.660 --> 00:37:58.160
Tell me your plan

00:38:09.540 --> 00:38:10.870
Your Majesty

00:38:10.870 --> 00:38:13.600
Hong Ha clan Jin Hae handed over their daughter to Su

00:38:13.600 --> 00:38:15.200
She's ready for marriage

00:38:16.790 --> 00:38:18.630
Did you say "Su"?

00:38:20.690 --> 00:38:23.950
Is she, by any chance, the cousin of my 8th son’s deceased wife?

00:38:25.160 --> 00:38:26.420
That's right

00:38:28.880 --> 00:38:31.590
Why this girl?

00:38:31.590 --> 00:38:33.810
These people are full of greed

00:38:34.510 --> 00:38:38.020
Would you like to cancel your wedding?

00:38:42.680 --> 00:38:44.980
It will be very difficult

00:38:44.980 --> 00:38:47.660
and where will I find another suitable girl?

00:38:49.530 --> 00:38:50.830
It's okay, let's go

00:39:19.530 --> 00:39:21.220
Isn't this Uk?

00:39:27.330 --> 00:39:31.860
I dared to come to discuss something with you

00:39:35.520 --> 00:39:39.770
Such a smart guy blocked my path?

00:39:42.520 --> 00:39:46.520
The imperial family already has many relatives

00:39:46.520 --> 00:39:49.520
Powerful clans want to keep the imperial family under control

00:39:51.120 --> 00:39:55.900
I'm interested in why you want to intermarry with another clan

00:39:55.900 --> 00:39:57.870
I have a good excuse

00:39:58.410 --> 00:40:02.800
I need the help of the He Clan to stop the war with the Khitan

00:40:03.750 --> 00:40:08.050
And for what reason do you want to stop my wedding?

00:40:14.810 --> 00:40:15.830
This...

00:40:19.310 --> 00:40:22.930
What about using a different method?

00:40:27.930 --> 00:40:29.850
What are you allowing yourself?!

00:40:29.850 --> 00:40:31.030
Your Majesty!

00:40:31.030 --> 00:40:34.710
Please hear us and stop the wedding

00:40:36.980 --> 00:40:39.710
Apparently your life is not worth it to you!

00:40:40.220 --> 00:40:44.740
I have a witness who will confirm that Hong Ha Jin is in cahoots with the Khitans

00:40:47.190 --> 00:40:48.750
You must punish him

00:40:48.750 --> 00:40:51.180
and choose a bride from another clan

00:40:51.780 --> 00:40:54.770
You could let the He clan be the magistrates of your city

00:40:54.770 --> 00:40:56.340
Reconciliation is also possible

00:40:58.400 --> 00:40:59.870
You don't need to get married

00:40:59.870 --> 00:41:02.160
There is another way to reduce its power

00:41:03.130 --> 00:41:05.650
Is it necessary to become relatives?

00:41:06.710 --> 00:41:08.090
Minister

00:41:08.090 --> 00:41:09.580
Yes, Your Majesty?

00:41:09.580 --> 00:41:11.640
I won't cancel the marriage

00:41:11.640 --> 00:41:12.940
Yes, Your Majesty

00:41:12.940 --> 00:41:17.020
If I punish him for collusion, like you said,

00:41:17.880 --> 00:41:21.220
sending the army will take a day, the borders of the state will be violated

00:41:22.230 --> 00:41:24.850
If we teach him a lesson,

00:41:24.850 --> 00:41:28.680
Aren't you afraid of other powerful clans?!

00:41:30.960 --> 00:41:36.170
In a palace, looking for reasons for actions is wrong

00:41:36.170 --> 00:41:39.540
We need to find a good excuse to stop this happening.

00:41:40.760 --> 00:41:42.210
Got it?

00:41:43.360 --> 00:41:44.910
And your reasons

00:41:46.600 --> 00:41:47.850
not enough

00:42:06.710 --> 00:42:07.870
Su!

00:42:15.090 --> 00:42:16.460
This reason

00:42:21.020 --> 00:42:22.920
will be enough

00:42:26.070 --> 00:42:27.180
What?

00:42:28.520 --> 00:42:32.420
If there is a scar on the body...

00:42:33.170 --> 00:42:36.520
I can't become a ruler's wife

00:42:39.660 --> 00:42:43.200
Therefore, Your Majesty, stop

00:42:44.320 --> 00:42:46.270
Let me go please

00:43:09.450 --> 00:43:11.650
You are more fearless than any man

00:43:15.000 --> 00:43:17.480
Bring Hong Ha Jin from the He Clan

00:43:17.480 --> 00:43:19.100
Yes, Your Majesty

00:43:23.270 --> 00:43:24.460
Su!

00:43:28.480 --> 00:43:29.660
Su!

00:43:36.480 --> 00:43:37.570
Su...

00:43:43.930 --> 00:43:45.120
Su!

00:43:45.120 --> 00:43:47.370
- Su!
- Sister, sister!

00:43:47.370 --> 00:43:48.960
Call the doctor!

00:43:50.890 --> 00:43:52.050
Quicker!

00:43:52.050 --> 00:43:53.450
Su! Quicker!

00:43:53.450 --> 00:43:55.460
How are you?!

00:44:12.290 --> 00:44:14.620
Where am I?

00:44:15.690 --> 00:44:20.120
Yes, I died, but that's not true

00:44:20.910 --> 00:44:23.940
Koryo... Taejo Wang Gon

00:44:24.260 --> 00:44:26.160
Gwangjong?

00:44:26.940 --> 00:44:29.640
Something about Gwangjong worries me

00:44:30.410 --> 00:44:32.640
I forgot something

00:44:35.060 --> 00:44:37.990
Fourth Emperor of Goryeo - Gwangjong

00:44:37.990 --> 00:44:40.970
Yes, he is the fourth ruler

00:44:41.520 --> 00:44:45.180
He killed his brothers and subjects

00:44:45.180 --> 00:44:47.520
Fourth Emperor of Goryeo - Gwangjong

00:44:48.440 --> 00:44:50.290
Who is he?

00:44:50.290 --> 00:44:52.700
Which prince?

00:44:52.700 --> 00:44:53.870
Really...

00:45:05.040 --> 00:45:06.720
No...

00:45:08.250 --> 00:45:09.800
Yes

00:45:09.800 --> 00:45:12.100
You didn't die, you survived

00:45:13.800 --> 00:45:15.920
And you're not married

00:45:15.920 --> 00:45:18.330
That's why I'm watching you instead of a doctor

00:45:23.370 --> 00:45:25.980
This is a palace, right?

00:45:28.180 --> 00:45:31.620
Since you are not dead, you are still in the palace

00:45:34.080 --> 00:45:38.750
Are you saying that you have to die to leave this place?

00:45:41.710 --> 00:45:45.320
The doctor said that the wound is deep, there will be a scar

00:45:48.500 --> 00:45:50.380
I expected this

00:45:52.410 --> 00:45:54.740
Don't you really want to be a ruler's wife?

00:45:55.700 --> 00:45:58.350
You could have everything you want

00:45:59.730 --> 00:46:04.750
It doesn't matter how I live,
I want to have the right to choose

00:46:06.310 --> 00:46:09.140
This is what people think when they are young

00:46:12.880 --> 00:46:15.610
You will soon be punished

00:46:15.610 --> 00:46:17.920
Get ready for this

00:46:19.190 --> 00:46:20.780
I won't regret it

00:46:22.740 --> 00:46:24.720
I defended what I wanted

00:46:26.470 --> 00:46:27.860
Now I'll pay

00:46:35.530 --> 00:46:36.920
Then rest

00:47:54.920 --> 00:47:56.740
Now everything will be fine

00:47:59.180 --> 00:48:00.450
It's over

00:48:03.760 --> 00:48:04.960
Emperor...

00:48:08.380 --> 00:48:09.460
Because...

00:48:16.370 --> 00:48:19.390
He called off the wedding because of your scar.

00:48:23.050 --> 00:48:24.080
Your clan...

00:48:25.160 --> 00:48:29.500
It was found that they went against the interests of the nation

00:48:30.790 --> 00:48:33.150
They won't put pressure on you anymore

00:48:45.060 --> 00:48:46.710
Last night...

00:48:49.520 --> 00:48:51.000
I felt pathetic

00:48:54.040 --> 00:48:55.400
Pathetic

00:48:59.620 --> 00:49:02.500
And once again pathetic, simply pathetic

00:49:06.020 --> 00:49:09.020
I thought I was a bad person

00:49:12.390 --> 00:49:14.270
And prayed to his late wife

00:49:17.230 --> 00:49:19.040
He said that if you come back,

00:49:23.820 --> 00:49:27.520
I will repay her by giving you those warm feelings that I didn’t give her

00:49:29.460 --> 00:49:31.860
I asked her for forgiveness and to return you to me

00:49:34.160 --> 00:49:35.300
Begged

00:49:41.410 --> 00:49:43.690
If you became the emperor's woman,

00:49:43.690 --> 00:49:49.100
I would never... be able to forgive myself

00:49:52.120 --> 00:49:53.800
I thought

00:49:55.890 --> 00:49:58.220
that I won't see you again

00:50:02.550 --> 00:50:05.190
I couldn't even say goodbye to you

00:50:06.970 --> 00:50:11.600
I don't think it would be right to break up like this

00:50:12.910 --> 00:50:13.960
So...

00:50:26.220 --> 00:50:28.040
This won't happen again

00:50:29.100 --> 00:50:30.670
I lost you one day

00:50:32.650 --> 00:50:35.610
but this won't happen again, so

00:50:39.130 --> 00:50:40.540
everything is fine

00:50:43.880 --> 00:50:45.240
Everything will be fine, Su

00:50:49.720 --> 00:50:51.020
Okay

00:51:01.020 --> 00:51:04.980
Your Majesty, the stars have disappeared, the sun will rise soon

00:51:04.980 --> 00:51:08.790
You must get some sleep to keep your throne

00:51:08.790 --> 00:51:10.120
Okay

00:51:13.560 --> 00:51:14.860
Your Majesty

00:51:14.860 --> 00:51:17.710
Have you already decided what to do with the He clan?

00:51:22.840 --> 00:51:26.260
Although I feel sorry for her,
but I can't break the law

00:51:28.360 --> 00:51:30.240
Make her a slave

00:51:32.190 --> 00:51:34.640
Why not just let her become a maid in the palace?

00:51:34.640 --> 00:51:37.310
Both Empress Yu and Queen Hwangbo will need

00:51:37.310 --> 00:51:41.850
Even Gwangjuwon's wife asked about Hae

00:51:41.850 --> 00:51:44.390
I'm sure the kids asked for it

00:51:45.680 --> 00:51:48.550
What is her relationship with the princes?

00:51:48.550 --> 00:51:51.300
Even 8th and 4th are involved

00:51:54.310 --> 00:51:56.650
I don't want to make a big deal out of this

00:51:56.650 --> 00:51:58.320
But...

00:51:59.720 --> 00:52:02.310
Concubine Oh from Damiwon Palace also submitted a petition

00:52:06.230 --> 00:52:07.380
Damiwon?

00:52:07.380 --> 00:52:11.270
I heard that Hae Soo is interested in medicinal herbs and paints women

00:52:11.270 --> 00:52:12.560
They say she can do a lot

00:52:12.560 --> 00:52:15.080
I believe that she will bring great benefit to the imperial family,

00:52:15.080 --> 00:52:16.440
if we leave her with concubine O

